cases.requirementText:
Corporate Tax Computation: Automate calculations for taxable income, deductions, capital allowances, and tax payable under the Income Tax Act 1967.

Ability to configure tax computation based on Malaysian tax law speficially:
(a) Rules-driven computation from GL PBT to adjusted income; 
(b) Configurable add-backs/exempt income/ expense items with manual categorization; 
(c) Computed Capital Allowances flows into tax computation; 
(d) Include other allowable expenses (e.g., donations); 
(e) Apply prevailing tax rate to chargeable income; 
(f) Allow manual adjustment of chargeable income (for examples; adjustment on movements in provisions).

The computation can be exported to Excel in a tax computation layout.

Geographical Location
To provide information for geographic region locations where Bursa Malaysia’s systems and data will be stored/processed for the following environment:
a)        Production;
b)        Disaster recovery;
c)        Development; and
d)      Testing.
